MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4e418474bb2a30542b702a5d9eab1987, type: 3}
  m_Name: Espejos02_EN
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textoPreguntaInicial: How much does this statement reflect your own beliefs?
  textoPreguntaRating: Rate from 1-10 how much you identify with this mirror
  textoFeedbackLike: "Great! Let's keep looking for the real you\u2026"
  textoFeedbackDislikeFinal: "Ok\u2026 just keep this in mind and keep looking on
    for the real you\u2026"
  textoDoYouAgree: Do you agree?
  espejos:
  - nombre: I must do well and get the approval of everybody who matters to me or
      I will be a worthless person.
    feedback01: Remember that not everyone is always going to like you and that's
      okay.
    feedback02: '"Keep in mind that your personal worth should not depend on other
      people''s approval.'
  - nombre: Other people must treat me kindly and fairly or else they are bad.
    feedback01: Remember that people sometimes act unkind and unfair because, just
      like you, they have their own struggles and are not always able to behave friendly.
    feedback02: You may consider that bad behavior is not necessarily a reflection
      of malice.
  - nombre: I must have an easy, enjoyable life or I cannot enjoy living at all.
    feedback01: Remember that life is unpredictable and is filled with both challenges
      and enjoyment.
    feedback02: Keep in mind that it's the very nature of life's ups and downs that
      make it a rich and meaningful experience and give you the opportunity to learn
      & grow.
  - nombre: All the people who matter to me must love me and approve of me or it
      will be awful.
    feedback01: "Remember that those people who love and care about you, have their
      own opinions and not need to agree with or approve of everything you do.This
      does not mean that they don\u2019t love you or love you less"
    feedback02: Consider that true connections are built on understanding, empathy,
      and the ability to work through disagreements.
  - nombre: I must be a high achiever or I will be worthless.
    feedback01: Remember that your personal worth comes from who you are, not just
      from what you accomplish or from what you have
    feedback02: Keep in mind that making mistakes and experiencing setbacks are part
      of the human experience.
  - nombre: Nobody should ever behave badly and if they do I should condemn them.
    feedback01: Remember that people are not perfect, and they can be influenced
      by unfortunate events, experiences, and emotions, which can lead to bad behavior.
    feedback02: You may consider consider adopting a more empathetic and constructive
      approach, trying to understand the reasons of their actions, instead of immediately
      condemning those who behave badly.
  - nombre: "I mustn\u2019t be frustrated in getting what I want and if I am it will
      be terrible."
    feedback01: "Remember that it is not terrible to feel frustrated, it\u2019s simply
      a signal that something is not going as planned."
    feedback02: "Keep in mind that frustration is a common emotional response to
      obstacles, delays, and unmet expectations, which can be a valuable source of
      motivation and growth and are part of everybody\u2019s lives."
  - nombre: '"When things are tough and I am under pressure I must be miserable and
      there is nothing I can do about this.'
    feedback01: 'Remember that in difficult moments it is normal to feel miserable,
      but there is always at least something you can do: decide how you take the
      setback.'
    feedback02: You may consider different things you can do to manage stress and
      improve your emotional state, rather than resigning yourself to misery."},        
      {"When faced with the possibility of something frightening or dangerous happening
      to me I must obsess about it and make frantic efforts to avoid it.", "You may
      consider adopting a more rational and measured approach to addressing potential
      risks by evaluating the likelihood and severity of the threat objectively,
      and taking reasonable precautions to mitigate it.
  - nombre: When faced with the possibility of something frightening or dangerous
      happening to me I must obsess about it and make frantic efforts to avoid it.
    feedback01: "Remember that, while it\u2018s ok to be concerned about potential
      dangers or frightening situations, excessive worry and avoidance behaviors
      can make you feel even more anxious."
    feedback02: 'You may want to approach potential risks more objectively and thoughtfully
      by assessing how likely and severe you perceive the threat to be, in order
      to take appropriate precautions. '
  - nombre: "I can avoid my responsibilities and dealing with life\u2019s difficulties
      and still be fulfilled."
    feedback01: Remember that, while it's tempting to avoid responsibility and difficulties,
      doing so can prevent you from realizing your potential and enjoy life at its
      fullest.
    feedback02: Keep in mind that life comes with challenges, moral obligations,
      and responsibilities, and attempting to evade them will likely lead to greater
      stress and unhappiness in the long run.
  - nombre: My past is the most important part of my life and it will keep on dictating
      how I feel and what I do.
    feedback01: Remember the past may limit your options, but it does not completely
      determine you. Instead of dwelling on the past and feeling trapped by it, focus
      on what you can control in the present.
    feedback02: '"You may consider that, despite your past, you have the power to
      make choices and decisions in the present moment that can influence your future.'
  - nombre: "Everybody and everything should be better than they are and, if they\u2019re
      not, it\u2019s awful."
    feedback01: Remember that expecting everybody and everything to be perfect is
      an unattainable goal, because life is filled with imperfections, both in people
      and circumstances.
    feedback02: Keep in mind that the pursuit of improvement is a natural and ongoing
      process that should be balanced with an acceptance of reality.
  - nombre: I can be as happy as is possible by doing as little as I can and by just
      enjoying myself.
    feedback01: Remember that a happy life is not only about seeking pleasure, but
      also about accepting life's challenges.
    feedback02: 'Keep in mind that being happy involves setting meaningful goals
      and pursuing them, contributing to others, and personal growth; all of these
      aspects require effort, responsibility, and overcoming challenges. '
